s\" - we used to call him Strays - \"Strays, do this. \" Strays would pick up from him and continue. No dialogue. It was almost like they knew which way they were going before they did it. That's unbelievable, but that's true.", "type": "string"}, "datatype": "string"}, "type": "statement", "id": "Q11147$29505E66-6E8E-4294-869F-8E9609267ADE", "rank": "normal"}], "P20": [{"mainsnak": {"snaktype": "value", "property": "P20", "hash": "979f4661cbbff3fd84b6e3fae01cd1601e0411b6", "datavalue": {"value": "https://semlab.s3.amazonaws.com/texts/8c3ff6578b7b25fa86a7c9d7a9053d1b/351.txt", "type": "string"}, "datatype": "url"}, "type": "statement", "id": "Q11147$10FDCFD7-3269-4011-A8A1-7797837CCE75", "rank": "normal"}], "P21": [{"mainsnak": {"snaktype": "value", "property": "P21", "hash": "f44662a78c69afa19b69a47805ad4df373539269", "datavalue": {"value": {"entity-type": "item", "numeric-id": 64, "id": "Q64"}, "type": "wikibase-entityid"}, "datatype": "wikibase-item"}, "type": "statement", "id": "Q11147$002CA12C-4825-4AB3-93D5-7E63808B889B", "rank": "normal"}], "P22": [{"mainsnak": {"snaktype": "value", "property": "P22", "hash": "0e5ce292df993d79dcf01467e0e5a2c8509775e9", "datavalue": {"value": {"entity-type": "item", "numeric-id": 240, "id": "Q240"}, "type": "wikibase-entityid"}, "datatype": "wikibase-item"}, "type": "statement", "id": "Q11147$1AD62B4A-051B-4080-816C-93304C71C73A", "rank": "normal"}], "P23": [{"mainsnak": {"snaktype": "value", "property": "P23", "hash": "6728b1d69fb03de3e91c83a040b2b8876a0c8810", "datavalue": {"value": {"entity-type": "item", "numeric-id": 240, "id": "Q240"}, "type": "wikibase-entityid"}, "datatype": "wikibase-item"}, "type": "statement", "id": "Q11147$5C275CAF-C8E6-4D33-8B2E-A76D2796C4CA", "rank": "normal"}]}}